        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spirit Whisperer Conversation with Kamiko</strong> is a visual novel about a restless ghost, whom people never understood. Tonight, you’ve been sent to speak with her. Not as a friend. Not as family. As a stranger who hears the dead. There are things Kamiko never said while she was alive. Will you hear her out?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You arrived just at the right time. You see her. You see Kamiko.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828350/extras/c0817544435f68f2910295053c0e5dd9.poster.avif?t=1776950700\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828350/extras/c0817544435f68f2910295053c0e5dd9.webm?t=1776950700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828350/extras/c0817544435f68f2910295053c0e5dd9.mp4?t=1776950700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to her and ask questions regarding her life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828350/extras/5c0267da88852435aa28cf654caa2507.poster.avif?t=1776950700\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828350/extras/5c0267da88852435aa28cf654caa2507.webm?t=1776950700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828350/extras/5c0267da88852435aa28cf654caa2507.mp4?t=1776950700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She might take what you say very seriously, so choose your responses wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828350/extras/dbafca580158cd9756b798da58532a38.poster.avif?t=1776950700\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828350/extras/dbafca580158cd9756b798da58532a38.webm?t=1776950700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828350/extras/dbafca580158cd9756b798da58532a38.mp4?t=1776950700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you get her to accept peace?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828350/extras/4d70615fcffd21bbb9082ef769631e98.poster.avif?t=1776950700\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828350/extras/4d70615fcffd21bbb9082ef769631e98.webm?t=1776950700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828350/extras/4d70615fcffd21bbb9082ef769631e98.mp4?t=1776950700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or will your choice lead her to another fate?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828350/extras/64fd5ff92734ecf26302273a272df020.poster.avif?t=1776950700\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828350/extras/64fd5ff92734ecf26302273a272df020.webm?t=1776950700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828350/extras/64fd5ff92734ecf26302273a272df020.mp4?t=1776950700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spirit Whisperer Conversation with Kamiko</strong> is a visual novel about a restless ghost, whom people never understood. Tonight, you’ve been sent to speak with her. Not as a friend. Not as family. As a stranger who hears the dead. There are things Kamiko never said while she was alive. Will you hear her out?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You arrived just at the right time. You see her. You see Kamiko.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828350/extras/c0817544435f68f2910295053c0e5dd9.poster.avif?t=1776950700\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828350/extras/c0817544435f68f2910295053c0e5dd9.webm?t=1776950700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828350/extras/c0817544435f68f2910295053c0e5dd9.mp4?t=1776950700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to her and ask questions regarding her life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828350/extras/5c0267da88852435aa28cf654caa2507.poster.avif?t=1776950700\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828350/extras/5c0267da88852435aa28cf654caa2507.webm?t=1776950700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828350/extras/5c0267da88852435aa28cf654caa2507.mp4?t=1776950700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She might take what you say very seriously, so choose your responses wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828350/extras/dbafca580158cd9756b798da58532a38.poster.avif?t=1776950700\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828350/extras/dbafca580158cd9756b798da58532a38.webm?t=1776950700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828350/extras/dbafca580158cd9756b798da58532a38.mp4?t=1776950700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you get her to accept peace?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828350/extras/4d70615fcffd21bbb9082ef769631e98.poster.avif?t=1776950700\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828350/extras/4d70615fcffd21bbb9082ef769631e98.webm?t=1776950700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828350/extras/4d70615fcffd21bbb9082ef769631e98.mp4?t=1776950700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or will your choice lead her to another fate?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828350/extras/64fd5ff92734ecf26302273a272df020.poster.avif?t=1776950700\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828350/extras/64fd5ff92734ecf26302273a272df020.webm?t=1776950700\" type=\"video/